    "title": "Who are the Central Iowa area high school alumni in action on Saturday, Nov. 22?",
    "text": "Kaleb McCullough and Caden Matson\nKaleb McCullough and Caden Matson\nBreck Mills\nWayne State Wildcats\nGuard\nSophomore\n6′0″\nSoutheast Valley High School\nHometown: Harcourt\nNext Game: vs. Chadron State Eagles, Saturday, Nov. 22, 4 p.m.\nCaden Matson\nIowa State Cyclones\nJunior\n6′0″ 205\nHumboldt High School\nHometown: Humboldt\nNext Game: vs. Kansas Jayhawks, Saturday, Nov. 22, 12 a.m.\nCayden Schultz\nCoe Kohawks\nJunior\n6′0″ 160\nEagle Grove High School\nHometown: Eagle Grove\nNext Game: vs. Concordia Wisconsin Falcons, Saturday, Nov. 22, 12 p.m.\nKaleb McCullough\nNorthwest Missouri State Bearcats\nSophomore\n6′2″ 278\nHumboldt High School\nHometown: Humboldt\nNext Game: vs. Harding Bison, Saturday, Nov. 22, 1 p.m.\nKeegan Hisler\nCoe Kohawks\nSophomore\n6′0″ 180\nWebster City High School\nHometown: Webster City\nNext Game: vs. Concordia Wisconsin Falcons, Saturday, Nov. 22, 12 p.m.",
